WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.955 --> 00:00:02.262
HAPPENS, RIGHT?

00:00:02.263 --> 00:00:04.082
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU BOTH.

00:00:04.116 --> 00:00:05.700
&gt;&gt; THERE ARE TWO THINGS THAT

00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:07.171
THE BIDEN ADMINISTRATION HAS

00:00:07.205 --> 00:00:08.621
TRIED TO HIDE FROM THE AMERICAN

00:00:08.655 --> 00:00:09.060
PUBLIC.

00:00:09.094 --> 00:00:11.662
ONE IS THE MASSIVE NUMBER OF

00:00:11.696 --> 00:00:13.819
PEOPLE WHO ARE COMING ACROSS

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:15.329
THE BORDER AND THE BIDEN

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:16.380
ADMINISTRATION’S LACK OF

00:00:16.414 --> 00:00:17.522
PREPARATION TO DEAL WITH THIS

00:00:17.557 --> 00:00:18.228
MASSIVE NUMBER.

00:00:18.262 --> 00:00:20.223
THE SECOND THING THEY WANT TO

00:00:20.225 --> 00:00:22.655
HIDE IS THIS, THAT IS THAT WITH

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:24.891
EVERY PERSON COMING ACROSS THE

00:00:24.892 --> 00:00:26.607
BORDER, IT EMPOWERS AND IT

00:00:26.608 --> 00:00:28.144
ENRICHES THE DRUG CARTELS.

00:00:28.145 --> 00:00:30.651
&gt;&gt; Bill: THAT FROM LAST HOUR

00:00:30.686 --> 00:00:31.836
TEXAS GOVERNOR GREG ABBOTT.

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:32.367
INTERESTING CONVERSATION

00:00:32.369 --> 00:00:33.914
ADDRESSING THE CRISIS HERE.

00:00:33.916 --> 00:00:36.050
IT IS NOT JUST AN ISSUE IN

00:00:36.051 --> 00:00:36.499
TEXAS.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.421
YOU LOOK AT A BIRD’S EYE VIEW

00:00:39.423 --> 00:00:41.804
OF A NEW MEXICO CATTLE RANCHERS

00:00:41.838 --> 00:00:43.618
PROPERTY WHERE THE UNFINISHED

00:00:43.652 --> 00:00:46.448
BORDER WALL LEAVES A MILE LONG

00:00:46.449 --> 00:00:48.627
GAPING HOLE AFTER PRESIDENT

00:00:48.628 --> 00:00:50.755
BIDEN HALTED CONSTRUCTION ON

00:00:50.756 --> 00:00:52.732
THE 20th OF JANUARY ALLOWING

00:00:52.733 --> 00:00:54.391
MIGRANTS TO CROSS THE BORDER

00:00:54.392 --> 00:00:55.372
INTO THE U.S.

00:00:55.373 --> 00:00:56.828
MICHAEL JOHNSON IS THE RANCHER

00:00:56.863 --> 00:00:58.345
AND WITH US NOW.

00:00:58.379 --> 00:01:00.190
THANK YOU FOR YOUR TIME.

00:01:00.224 --> 00:01:01.172
I’VE HEARD COMMENTS FROM

00:01:01.206 --> 00:01:01.578
RANCHERS.

00:01:01.579 --> 00:01:04.796
THE GENERAL THEME SEEMS TO BE

00:01:04.797 --> 00:01:06.087
THEY’RE AFRAID.

00:01:06.089 --> 00:01:06.906
ARE YOU?

00:01:06.908 --> 00:01:09.305
&gt;&gt; WELL, YOU KNOW, LIVING DOWN

00:01:09.306 --> 00:01:11.506
HERE ON THE BORDER YOU CAN’T

00:01:11.507 --> 00:01:13.232
LIVE IN FEAR BUT THE WAY

00:01:13.233 --> 00:01:14.881
EVERYTHING IS GOING NOWADAYS

00:01:14.915 --> 00:01:16.572
WITH THE NEW POLICIES PUT FORTH

00:01:16.607 --> 00:01:17.699
BY THIS ADMINISTRATION, IT IS

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:19.154
MAKING THINGS A LOT MORE

00:01:19.188 --> 00:01:21.203
DIFFICULT AND A LOT MORE UNSAFE

00:01:21.237 --> 00:01:22.841
IN OUR AREA.

00:01:22.875 --> 00:01:25.503
&gt;&gt; Dana: DO YOU HAVE MUCH LAW

00:01:25.504 --> 00:01:27.369
ENFORCEMENT THERE IN YOUR AREA?

00:01:27.404 --> 00:01:29.298
IT’S PRETTY RURAL PART OF THE

00:01:29.299 --> 00:01:30.096
COUNTRY.

00:01:30.131 --> 00:01:31.983
&gt;&gt; WE’RE VERY RURAL.

00:01:32.017 --> 00:01:33.139
OUR SHERIFF’S DEPARTMENT IS

00:01:33.141 --> 00:01:34.664
STRETCHED PRETTY THIN.

00:01:34.699 --> 00:01:37.265
WHEN IT COMES TO LAW

00:01:37.266 --> 00:01:39.164
ENFORCEMENT WE RELY HEAVILY ON

00:01:39.198 --> 00:01:40.066
OUR BORDER PATROL.

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.443
AND THEIR RESOURCES ARE

00:01:41.477 --> 00:01:43.918
STRETCHED PRETTY THIN NOW WITH

00:01:43.919 --> 00:01:46.029
THE INFLUX OF ILLEGAL ACTIVITY

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:48.157
CROSSING ESPECIALLY IN THE

00:01:48.191 --> 00:01:50.774
SANTA THERESA AREA EAST OF US.

00:01:50.808 --> 00:01:52.205
THAT’S ALLOWING THESE CRIMINAL

00:01:52.207 --> 00:01:53.274
ELEMENTS IN MEXICO TO EXPLOIT

00:01:53.275 --> 00:01:54.009
THIS.

00:01:54.011 --> 00:01:57.278
SO FOOT TRAFFIC IN OUR AREA HAS

00:01:57.312 --> 00:01:58.102
INCREASED SIGNIFICANTLY SINCE

00:01:58.137 --> 00:01:58.977
THEY HALTED BORDER WALL

00:01:59.012 --> 00:01:59.276
CONSTRUCTION.

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:00.767
&gt;&gt; Bill: WHAT WAS THE EFFECT OF

00:02:00.769 --> 00:02:02.983
THAT WHEN THEY STOPPED BUILDING

00:02:02.985 --> 00:02:05.123
THE WALL FOR YOU SPECIFICALLY?

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:06.793
THAT WAS ON YOUR PROPERTY,

00:02:06.795 --> 00:02:07.228
RIGHT?

00:02:07.229 --> 00:02:08.442
&gt;&gt; CORRECT.

00:02:08.443 --> 00:02:10.522
WE HAVE A THREE QUARTER MILE

00:02:10.556 --> 00:02:10.906
GAP.

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:12.825
ALONG WITH ANOTHER SMALLER GAP

00:02:12.826 --> 00:02:14.532
AND THEY ARE EXPLOITING THIS.

00:02:14.566 --> 00:02:16.047
WE DON’T HAVE THE UNACCOMPANIED

00:02:16.048 --> 00:02:18.689
MINORS COMING THROUGH OUR AREA.

00:02:18.724 --> 00:02:20.460
WHAT WE HAVE IS THE CRIMINAL

00:02:20.495 --> 00:02:20.981
ELEMENT.

00:02:21.016 --> 00:02:23.884
A NEIGHBOR TO OUR WEST HAD

00:02:23.885 --> 00:02:25.615
BORDER PATROL APPREHEND A GROUP

00:02:25.616 --> 00:02:27.385
OF 12 PEOPLE WEARING CAMOUFLAGE

00:02:27.386 --> 00:02:28.230
AND SKI MASKS.

00:02:28.264 --> 00:02:29.499
THOSE ARE UPSTANDING PEOPLE

00:02:29.534 --> 00:02:31.257
COMING HERE LOOKING FOR A JOB.

00:02:31.258 --> 00:02:32.944
THIS IS A CRIMINAL ELEMENT THAT

00:02:32.946 --> 00:02:34.635
WE’RE DEALING WITH OUT IN THESE

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:35.742
RURAL AREAS.

00:02:35.743 --> 00:02:37.565
&gt;&gt; Dana: WE’RE SEEING DRONE

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:39.021
FOOTAGE OF YOUR RANCH WHICH IS

00:02:39.055 --> 00:02:40.693
STUNNING AND A BEAUTIFUL PLACE

00:02:40.727 --> 00:02:42.806
AND YOU HAVE SO MUCH LOVE FOR

00:02:42.807 --> 00:02:44.335
YOUR LANDMENT I’M SURE YOU HAVE

00:02:44.336 --> 00:02:45.507
A LOT OF LIVESTOCK THERE AND

00:02:45.508 --> 00:02:47.055
WORRY FOR THEM.

00:02:47.090 --> 00:02:49.655
HAVE YOU SEEN EVIDENCE OF ANY

00:02:49.656 --> 00:02:52.574
SORT OF CARTEL ACTIVITY OR

00:02:52.575 --> 00:02:54.235
COYOTE ACTIVITY ESPECIALLY WITH

00:02:54.236 --> 00:02:54.937
DRUGS?

00:02:54.938 --> 00:02:57.716
&gt;&gt; I HAVE NEVER SEEN DRUG

00:02:57.751 --> 00:02:59.296
ACTIVITY SPECIFICALLY.

00:02:59.297 --> 00:03:01.799
LIKE I SAY, FOOT TRAFFIC HAS

00:03:01.801 --> 00:03:03.423
INCREASED SIGNIFICANTLY.

00:03:03.425 --> 00:03:07.112
APPROXIMATELY ONE MILE FROM MY

00:03:07.114 --> 00:03:09.265
HOUSE LAST SATURDAY THE BORDER

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:11.007
PATROL PICKED UP TRACKS THE

00:03:11.041 --> 00:03:13.202
SIGNS FOR A GROUP OF 50 PLUS

00:03:13.204 --> 00:03:15.262
THAT WENT THROUGH THAT GATE AND

00:03:15.264 --> 00:03:16.723
OF THAT 50 THEY ONLY CAUGHT 30

00:03:16.724 --> 00:03:17.240
OF THEM.

00:03:17.275 --> 00:03:18.836
THE 20 OTHER PEOPLE MADE IT

00:03:18.838 --> 00:03:20.750
THROUGH AND WE HAVE NO IDEA WHO

00:03:20.751 --> 00:03:22.317
THAT WAS OR WHAT THEY WERE

00:03:22.319 --> 00:03:23.973
DOING OR WHAT THEY WERE

00:03:24.008 --> 00:03:25.291
CARRYING.

00:03:25.292 --> 00:03:29.072
&gt;&gt; IT’S THE 19th OF MARCH.

00:03:29.106 --> 00:03:31.077
WHAT HAPPENS ON THE 19th OF

00:03:31.111 --> 00:03:33.733
APRIL AND THE 19th OF MAY DO

00:03:33.734 --> 00:03:35.521
YOU THINK WITH THIS?

00:03:35.522 --> 00:03:37.827
&gt;&gt; WELL, THAT’S ONE OF OUR BIG

00:03:37.829 --> 00:03:39.514
CONCERNS AS THE WEATHER

00:03:39.548 --> 00:03:41.437
IMPROVES AND GETS WARMER, IT

00:03:41.438 --> 00:03:43.311
WILL MAKE CROSSING A LOT EASIER

00:03:43.313 --> 00:03:45.367
FOR THESE PEOPLE BECAUSE THE

00:03:45.368 --> 00:03:47.275
ELEMENTS WON’T BE AS BAD.

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:49.349
SO IT’S GOING TO INCREASE.

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:50.734
WE’RE A FUNNELING POINT.

00:03:50.735 --> 00:03:52.881
WE’RE THE FIRST MAJOR GAP

00:03:52.882 --> 00:03:54.690
COMING WEST OUT OF EL PASO,

00:03:54.724 --> 00:03:56.066
TEXAS, APPROXIMATELY 90 MILES

00:03:56.100 --> 00:03:56.512
AWAY.

00:03:56.547 --> 00:03:57.957
WE’LL HAVE A SIGNIFICANT

00:03:57.991 --> 00:04:01.660
INCREASE OF TRAFFIC TO OUR AREA

00:04:01.695 --> 00:04:03.918
AND IT WILL AFFECT THE SAFETY

00:04:03.952 --> 00:04:05.924
OF MY FAMILY, OUR BUSINESS, THE

00:04:05.925 --> 00:04:07.129
PEOPLE OF THIS COUNTY.

00:04:07.131 --> 00:04:09.098
PEOPLE DON’T REALIZE THIS ISN’T

00:04:09.099 --> 00:04:10.268
JUST A BORDER PROBLEM.

00:04:10.303 --> 00:04:10.994
THIS AFFECTS EVERYBODY.

00:04:10.995 --> 00:04:12.646
WE’RE JUST THE FIRST ONES THAT

00:04:12.647 --> 00:04:13.283
SEE IT.

00:04:13.317 --> 00:04:15.771
&gt;&gt; Dana: COULD I ASK YOU IF YOU

00:04:15.772 --> 00:04:18.930
HEAR ANYTHING AT ALL FROM YOUR

00:04:18.965 --> 00:04:19.904
ELECTED LEADERSHIP IN

00:04:19.905 --> 00:04:20.750
WASHINGTON, D.C.?

00:04:20.785 --> 00:04:23.078
SENATORS, CONGRESS PEOPLE, OR

00:04:23.112 --> 00:04:25.250
EVEN THE NEW SECRETARY OF

00:04:25.285 --> 00:04:26.172
INTERIOR?

00:04:26.206 --> 00:04:28.772
&gt;&gt; WE’VE BEEN IN CONTACT WITH

00:04:28.773 --> 00:04:30.201
OUR REPRESENTATIVE AND HER

00:04:30.235 --> 00:04:31.721
OFFICE HAS BEEN REAL GOOD ABOUT

00:04:31.723 --> 00:04:33.839
LISTENING TO OUR CONCERNS AND

00:04:33.873 --> 00:04:36.497
TRYING TO HELP US OUT WITH THIS

00:04:36.498 --> 00:04:39.255
MATTER BUT OTHER THAN THAT,

00:04:39.289 --> 00:04:40.125
IT’S BEEN SILENT.

00:04:40.159 --> 00:04:41.620
EVEN OUR GOVERNOR DOESN’T TAKE

00:04:41.654 --> 00:04:42.662
NOTICE OF THIS ISSUE.

00:04:42.663 --> 00:04:44.157
THAT’S WHAT IS CONCERNING TO ME.

00:04:44.158 --> 00:04:46.429
I HAVE A RED STATE TO MY WEST

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:47.899
AND A RED STATE TO THE EAST

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:49.795
THAT IF THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT

00:04:49.829 --> 00:04:51.390
DOESN’T TAKE CARE OF THIS

00:04:51.424 --> 00:04:52.257
ISSUE, THEIR STATE GOVERNMENT

00:04:52.258 --> 00:04:52.792
WILL.

00:04:52.793 --> 00:04:55.769
AND THAT’S GOING TO PUSH ALL OF

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:57.372
THEIR TRAFFIC TO NEW MEXICO.

